# ── Build output (generated by build.sh) ──────────────────────────────────────
build/

# ── macOS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# ── Xcode (should not appear here, but just in case) ─────────────────────────
*.xcuserstate
DerivedData/
*.xcarchive

# ── Releases (DMGs produced by make_dmg.sh — uploaded manually to GitHub) ────
# Note: releases/ lives outside this repo (at project root/distribution/releases/)
# Nothing to ignore here for that folder.

# ── GitHub configuration (override global gitignore which ignores all dotfolders) ──
!.github/
!.github/**
# …but still ignore Finder files inside it (the negation above would otherwise re-include them)
.github/**/.DS_Store
.github/.DS_Store
